# Then build four real levels

## L1 — Simulated invocation

Give the model actual function definitions.

Don't ask it which tool it wants.

Give it something like:

```text
tools:

tool_7f3(...)
tool_d12(...)
tool_ab8(...)
tool_931(...)
...
```

Then simply say:

