# Add perturbation tests

Every confirmed effect should survive metamorphic variants.

For example:

```text
"I need to check whether x.com is free"
"Can you see if x.com can be registered?"
"Determine x.com's registration availability."
```

Semantically equivalent task.

Expected state identical.

The treatment effect should not disappear because one phrase changed.

ReliabilityBench's concept of evaluating robustness under semantic perturbation and API failures is highly applicable here. ([arXiv][7])

